# Linear (MLCC Website)

This repo is tied to the **MLCC Website** Linear project. Canonical IDs live in `linear.config.json`.

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Project | MLCC Website |
| Project ID | `7987d67b-317a-4f02-8e14-72bf82aeed3f` |
| Team key | `MWO` (issues look like `MWO-123`) |

## Pull an issue by ID

Use the **Linear** MCP server (`plugin-linear-linear`):

1. **`get_issue`** — pass the identifier the user gives you:
   - Team key form: `MWO-434`
   - Or the UUID from a Linear URL
2. Set `includeRelations: true` when dependencies (blocked by / blocking) matter.

Example: user says "build MWO-432" → call `get_issue` with `id: "MWO-432"`.

## List project issues

Use **`list_issues`** with `project: "7987d67b-317a-4f02-8e14-72bf82aeed3f"` to scope results to this repo.

## Parse issue links

`https://linear.app/midwestern/issue/MWO-434/banner` → identifier `MWO-434`.

## Status workflow

When implementing issues end-to-end, use the `build-linear-issue` skill. When planning only, use `plan-linear-issue`.
